不是9？答案讓家長網民罵翻（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"小學一年級數學題「5隻狗＋4隻狗」竟不是9？答案讓家長網民罵翻（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250619/1012307997793325056812456.jpeg/Dxwxkb95FC8rxWqnFay3tIix-wwZ55crdhAcR3YQHEc\"/><figcaption>小學一年級數學題「5隻狗＋4隻狗」竟不是9？答案讓家長網民罵翻（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"小學一年級數學題「5隻狗＋4隻狗」竟不是9？答案讓家長網民罵翻（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250619/1012308000385536000628495.jpeg/Jt_RxN7M1UgL-LGWH7Oms49jMRjYbbuxDmk9jg5pPY4\"/><figcaption>小學一年級數學題「5隻狗＋4隻狗」竟不是9？答案讓家長網民罵翻（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><p>紅果短劇爆紅篡位Netflix！網沉迷追劇「幾天沒睡」 醫揭上癮原因</p><p>IG挑戰YouTube！要推最長90分鐘橫向長影片格式 手機看片Hold得住嗎？</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T01:41:20.353445+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1533,"images":22,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T01:30:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T03:18:34.204339+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T01:38:28.744539+00:00","content_hash":"a4afe303fdf678a31b8d2fd9ead90e64053b838eba545f168a5a18e80c27de66","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}